{
  "dom_id": "step-73029",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Evaluating Linear Expressions",
  "problem": "Evaluate $11p-2$ for $p=4.$",
  "worked_solution": "Replacing $p$ with $\\color{blue}4$ in the expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t11p-2 &= \\\n\t\t11({\\color{blue}4})-2 &= \\\n\t \t44-2 &= \\\n\t \t42 .\n\t}\n$$",
